WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:09.312
Earthquake inspection prioritisation for the Eastern Massachusetts highway benchmark network. Start with no observations or results.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:15.160
After an earthquake, which bridge inspections would help restore access to the airports?

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.536
Blue nodes describe uncertain shaking at each bridge.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:24.760
Orange nodes model station readings, including measurement uncertainty.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.904
Green nodes translate shaking into probabilities of bridge damage.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:34.512
Yellow nodes describe whether each road is open or closed.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:40.648
Pink nodes show whether communities can reach an airport within the allowed extra travel time.
